  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Inclusive Blue Economy Transformation for Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UNDP-AUC Blue Economy Transformation Programme aims to accelerate the realization of a sustainable and inclusive Blue Economy in Africa. Anchored in the AU Blue Economy Strategy, this programme seeks to enhance capacities, promote regional trade, improve value chains, and foster collaboration at national, regional, and global levels.</narrative>
  </description>
